-  "Local knowledge-graph retrieval. Needs the optional dependency installed; indexing is LLM-heavy. Requires an active chat model and embedding model.": "本地知识图谱检索。需要安装可选依赖；索引为 LLM 密集型操作。需启用对话模型与嵌入模型。",
