-  "Server engine: retrieval runs on a standalone LightRAG service you operate. Save a reusable URL here, test it, then override it only when a knowledge base needs another server.": "服务器引擎：检索运行在你维护的独立 LightRAG 服务上。在这里保存并测试可复用的地址；只有某个知识库需要连接其他服务器时再单独覆盖。",
